= Reference sources and media

The visual reference is the public website of the Société des Pontonnier·ère·s
de Genève, inspected on 17 October 2026. Its Twenty Ten layout provides the
reference dimensions, colors and typography. The CSS here is a new implementation.

Content is adapted in French from the corresponding public pages. Detailed
archives remain on the original site. Public availability does not transfer
ownership of photographs, logos or other source material. Those assets retain
their original rights; no blanket license is assigned to them by this repository.

